{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Train | \u6700\u5f8c\u306e\u5217\u8eca</strong> is an atmospheric first-person psychological horror set in the depths of the Japanese subway. You play as a train operator returning to work after a tragedy. Each night shift grows more disturbing as reality begins to distort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the schedule, operate the train, respond to signals, and drop off passengers. But with every stop, the tension builds. Empty stations, silent tunnels, and the sense of something behind you turn routine into a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can\u2019t escape. You can only keep moving forward\u2014until it\u2019s time to pay for the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive horror with a strong atmosphere and minimalist presentation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradual tension buildup and surreal events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story of guilt, isolation, and inevitable reckoning</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress saves at the start of each chapter</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3829200?t=1769793847","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3829200?t=1769793847","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829200/c1dc5d6baa44821a13f1b7228bd908d5934f6494/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769793847","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829200/c1dc5d6baa44821a13f1b7228bd908d5934f6494/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769793847","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Cu